---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact & Project Inquiry | Strix Engineering Studio" description="Start a software engineering project with Strix Engineering Studio.">
<section class="section-space"><div class="strix-container space-y-12"><header class="max-w-4xl space-y-5 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="editorial-meta text-primary">Project Inquiry</p><h1 class="editorial-serif type-display-lg">Let's build something that works beyond launch.</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:text-base">Tell us what you're building, what needs to improve, or where your current product is facing engineering challenges.</p></header>
<div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12"><aside class="space-y-6 lg:col-span-4"><div class="border border-border bg-card p-6"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-primary">DIRECT CHANNELS</span><h2 class="editorial-serif mt-2 text-2xl">Contact the studio</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Reach Strix directly by email or phone, or use the inquiry channel below.</p><div class="mt-6 space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-5 text-sm"><div><p class="editorial-meta text-muted-foreground">Email</p><a href="mailto:team@strix.website">team@strix.website</a></div><div><p class="editorial-meta text-muted-foreground">Phone & WhatsApp</p><a href="tel:+918421334187">+91 84213 34187</a></div><div><p class="editorial-meta text-muted-foreground">Studio Location</p><p>India · Global Remote Delivery</p></div></div></div></aside>
<div class="lg:col-span-8 border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8"><span class="editorial-meta text-primary">PROJECT INQUIRY FORM</span><h2 class="editorial-serif mt-3 text-2xl">Tell us about the work.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">The legacy Next.js form posted to a private server API. The Astro migration intentionally does not send project data to a placeholder endpoint. Use the direct email channel until a verified form provider or endpoint is configured.</p><a href="mailto:team@strix.website?subject=Strix%20Project%20Inquiry" class="mt-6 inline-flex border border-primary bg-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">Email a project inquiry ↗</a></div>
</div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>